	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist concludes during the first session that a client is irresponsible and unlikely to improve. The therapist later:Interprets missed appointments as proof of poor motivation.Ignores the client’s transportation and childcare problems.Dismisses evidence of progress.Documents personal impressions as facts.Recommends discharge without discussing barriers.Seeks consultation only from a colleague who agrees with the original opinion.What is the most appropriate response?',
