		'correct_option' => 'c',
		'explanation'    => 'A. Incorrect. Competence requires ongoing monitoring and is not permanently guaranteed by licensure.
B. Incorrect. Graduate education is foundational, but later training, experience, current knowledge, and functioning also matter.
C. Correct. This accurately reflects the dynamic and context-specific nature of professional competence.
